  "prefLabel": "Env-Sw 203.02 Procedure",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Env-Sw 203.02 Procedure. Subject to Env-C 208.05, any person submitting information to the department may make a claim of confidentiality for all confidential business information, or any part thereof, pursuant to the criteria and procedures of Env-C 208.\n\nSource. (see Revision Note at chapter heading for Env-Sw 200) #8461-B, eff 10-28-05; ss by #10594, eff 7-1-14",
